  "details": "In a component that sits inside a Prefab, properties are marked in Bold Text when it's been modified from the state that was set by the Prefab it's inside of.\n\nThis works well on PhysBone Components, except for one area: The Limits -> Rotation. If you modify the Pitch, Roll, or Yaw, it does not mark the property as modified.\n\nOf course this is a minor inconvenience, but I find it pretty important for us Prefab creators to visually see that these Pitch, Roll, and Yaw values are recorded in the Prefab as well, and were modified.",
